{"id": "roam-quote-pass-wins", "rubric": "roaming", "persona": "the planner", "account": "NB-1007", "notes": "R6(a): a heavy trip priced both ways from her usage profile (0.9 GB/day x 8 days in Spain at $8.50/GB): pay-as-you-go $61.20 against the $30.00 pass, saving $31.20 stated. The projection passes the bill-shock threshold, so the guard leads and the sale waits for her assent.", "turns": [{"say": "I'm travelling to Spain for 8 days — what will roaming cost me, is a pass cheaper?", "expect": {"intent": "roaming", "identity_state": "unverified"}}, {"say": "NB-1007 postcode 02139", "expect": {"identity_state": "verifying"}}, {"say": "{code:NB-1007}", "expect": {"identity_state": "verified", "reply_contains_all": ["$61.20", "$30.00", "$31.20"], "reply_ordered": ["$61.20", "$30.00"], "action_status": "none"}}, {"say": "yes", "expect": {"action_status": "proposed"}}, {"say": "yes", "expect": {"action_status": "executed"}}], "final": {"balance_due": "75.00", "executed_kinds": ["activate_offer"]}}
